In general, that is probably the case but there are some specific
regions of the game where it seems (to me) to be far easier to just
grind.  The quest home level is one such place.  It's a no-teleport
level, the quest monsters never go extinct(on the quest) and there is
only a 14%(IIRC) chance of a different type of monster appearing.  So,
if you have favorable quest monsters (snakes, bats, wraiths could be
annoying and a random H could be a formidable titan), you can just
spam wait and if something dodgy gets generated, then mitigate the
threat and go back to waiting.

